><span class=\"syn-dot\">.Loading</span>,\n    <span class=\"syn-param\">title</span> = <span class=\"syn-str\">\"Processing your transaction\"</span>,\n    <span class=\"syn-param\">description</span> = <span class=\"syn-str\">\"This usually takes a few seconds.\"</span>\n<span class=\"syn-punc\">)</span>\n\n<span class=\"syn-cmt\">// Error</span>\n<span class=\"syn-type\">EBInlineMessage</span><span class=\"syn-punc\">(</span>\n    <span class=\"syn-param\">type</span> = <span class=\"syn-type\">EBInlineMessageType</span><span class=\"syn-dot\">.Error</span>,\n    <span class=\"syn-param\">title</span> = <span class=\"syn-str\">\"Transfer Failed\"</span>,\n    <span class=\"syn-param\">description</span> = <span class=\"syn-str\">\"Insufficient balance. Please top up and try again.\"</span>\n<span class=\"syn-punc\">)</span></code>"
